// Tier 3: large-scale content expansion sourced via parallel research
// agents (5 batches covering ~75 cities across the Americas/Caribbean,
// Western/Northern Europe, Eastern Europe/Middle East, Africa, and
// Asia). Every candidate went through the same two-gate process as
// every prior batch: real Commons license verification, then a direct
// visual inspection for baked-in spoiler text. This script's SEED data
// additionally passed a centralized re-verification pass: license and
// sourceUrl were independently re-derived and confirmed against the
// actual Commons file page (not taken from agent self-report alone),
// and a spot-check sample of images was personally re-inspected.
//
// Several candidates researched by the agents are deliberately NOT
// included here because a sourceUrl could not be independently
// re-confirmed (Santo Domingo, Monrovia, Maputo, Windhoek), one was
// rejected for being a modern (2014) photo rather than historical
// (Sana'a), and two cities had no clean candidate found at all after
// multiple genuine attempts (La Paz, Valparaíso) -- see
// CURATION_NOTES.md for the full record.
//
// Run once, from the repo root: node scripts/migrate-build-seed-items-tier3.js
